-Fable costs the most, so only the hardest implementation runs it at `xhigh`. These pairs hold at the `large` budget. Another budget moves every effort in the table by the steps it moves the role lines. A row replaces the default that a routed skill names for the same role. A role line replaces the model in every row of its role. A role line whose effort differs from what the rule's budget gives its default was set by hand, and its effort replaces the effort in those rows too. A rule whose `# budget` line names one effort, as in `large (xhigh)`, predates budgets that move efforts, so none of its role lines counts as set by hand. Never raise or lower an effort the table and the role lines give. A role on `auto` or `inherit-parent` stays on the parent model. If the Task tool rejects the effort, do not try another. Use the role's line or default and say so.
